      <rules>
        <rule id="81e7719b-6b92-51a9-ba2f-42641727d4c5" name="Psychotic Rampage" hidden="false">
          <description>In each of your Command Phases, perform a Ld Test. I this unit fails, it treats all units on the table as enemy units, and all units on the table may treat this unit as an enemy unit. During the Movement Phase, it must Move as much as possible to the closest enemy unit. In the Shooting Phase it must shoot the closest enemy unit, or if cannot do that, Advance towards the closest enemy unit so long as its further than 12” away. In the Assault Phase, this unit must Declare a Charge against the closest enemy unit if possible. If it is Embarked during your Command Phase it does not have to Test.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="e43a8d0f-0269-571c-900e-92e53160864b" name="Spinal Stimulants" hidden="false">
          <description>This model has a 4+ Feel No Pain.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
